<BaseLayout title="Progressive Delivery Platform on EKS — Amit Madakatti" description="An AWS EKS platform with Terraform, Argo CD, progressive canary delivery and observable rollbacks.">
<main class="case-page"><a class="back-link" href="/#selected-work">← ALL WORK</a><span class="eyebrow">CASE 01 / PLATFORM ENGINEERING / 2026</span><h1>Progressive delivery<br/><em>platform on EKS.</em></h1><p class="case-lead">A Kubernetes delivery platform designed to make releases gradual, observable and reversible.</p><div class="case-cover cover-lime"><div class="case-terminal"><div>release.strategy <b>progressive</b></div><div>traffic.split&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>10% → 50% → 100%</b></div><div>analysis.status <b>healthy</b></div><div>gitops.sync&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>in-sync</b></div></div></div><div class="case-meta"><div><span>ROLE</span><b>Platform Engineering</b></div><div><span>STACK</span><b>AWS EKS · Terraform · Argo CD · Argo Rollouts</b></div><div><span>YEAR</span><b>2026</b></div></div><div class="case-content"><section><span class="eyebrow">01 / THE BRIEF</span><h2>Safer releases,<br/><em>without the guesswork.</em></h2><p>Build a repeatable Kubernetes platform where application changes move through controlled traffic shifts, automated analysis and observable rollback paths.</p></section><section><span class="eyebrow">02 / THE BUILD</span><h2>Infrastructure<br/>as a delivery system.</h2><p>Provisioned EKS with Terraform and Karpenter. Argo CD reconciles application state from Git. Gateway API manages staged traffic, while Argo Rollouts runs canary analysis and coordinates promotion or rollback. Prometheus, Grafana, Loki and Alertmanager provide operational visibility.</p></section><section><span class="eyebrow">03 / THE OUTCOME</span><h2>Bad releases<br/><em>don't get through.</em></h2><p>A broken-image release was blocked from users, marked degraded and rolled back without downtime. Traffic splits were verified using real requests. The incident copilot was built but is not yet deployed.</p></section></div><a class="case-repo" href="https://github.com/amit-cloudops-ai/pdp-eks-gitops" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">VIEW SOURCE REPOSITORY ↗</a></main>
</BaseLayout>
